Artwork and card text

The vector card faces and all card interpretations in this repository are
original work by Gina Lyn Cox, written and drawn in the Rider-Waite-Smith
tradition, and are covered by the MIT terms above.

The original 1909 Rider-Waite-Smith illustrations by Pamela Colman Smith are in
the public domain in the United States. No scans or reproductions of those
plates are distributed in this repository. Copyright status varies by country;
check your own jurisdiction before distributing scans of the original deck.
